---
const supportUrl = "https://www.patreon.com/cw/Orishatory";
---

<div class="support-card">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M12 20.5s-7.5-4.4-7.5-10.3A4.2 4.2 0 0 1 12 7.6a4.2 4.2 0 0 1 7.5 2.6c0 5.9-7.5 10.3-7.5 10.3Z" />
  </svg>
  <h2>Soutenir le projet</h2>
  <p>
    Orishatory est un projet bénévole et sans publicité. Chaque soutien aide à continuer à sourcer
    et documenter de nouvelles fiches.
  </p>
  <a class="support-cta" href={supportUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Soutenir sur Patreon</a>
  <a class="support-link" href="/soutiens/">Voir les soutiens</a>
</div>

<style>
  .support-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
  }

  .support-card svg {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .support-card h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .support-card p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .support-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-fg);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      opacity var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out),
      transform 100ms var(--ease-out);
  }

  .support-cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  .support-cta:active {
    transform: scale(0.96);
    transition-duration: 100ms;
  }

  .support-link {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    transition: color var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .support-link:hover {
    color: var(--fg);
  }
</style>
